# ============================================================
# E-Rakshak Windows C2/Exfiltration Module — .gitignore
# ============================================================

# ---------- Packet captures & datasets ----------
# Never commit raw traffic — too large, and potentially contains PII.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap
*.crdownload
# Ignore data/ CONTENTS (not the dir itself) so specific subpaths can be
# re-included below. (Git can't descend into a fully-excluded directory, so
# each re-included directory needs its own negation before its contents.)
data/*

# KEEP shipped model artifacts + their training corpora (small, must ship:
# inference needs the JSON weights; retraining needs the wordlist/benign lists).
!data/models/

# KEEP the threat-intel feed snapshots (~210 KB). These are abuse.ch indicator
# lists, not samples or traffic — no PII, no executable content. They ship so
# that a fresh clone can rebuild data/threatintel.sqlite offline with
# `python scripts/seed_threatintel.py`. Without them an integrator gets the
# three built-in demo seeds and every reputation/attribution finding is empty.
# See data/feeds/README.md for provenance and refresh instructions.
!data/feeds/

# KEEP these small fixtures (previously force-tracked via `git add -f`;
# negated here so the repository is reproducible without manual steps).
!data/ground_truth.json
!data/access_events_fixture.json
!data/static_prior_agenttesla.json

# ---------- Generated / regenerable artifacts ----------
output/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/

# ---------- Threat-intel DB (regenerable via feed_import.py) ----------
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# ---------- Python packaging ----------
.Python
env/
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# ---------- Virtual environments ----------
.venv/
venv/
ENV/

# ---------- Coverage ----------
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------- Meeting Brief / Scratch ----------
MEETING_BRIEF.md

# ---------- IDE / editor ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Superseded local copies. The integration contract is owned by UMAT
# (MYTH-il/E-Rakshak-UMAT, contracts/) — see docs/umat_integration.md.
contract.DELETED-*/
